r now why they are getting  fired but the viewer does third the  Keim's are inside the house chrome to  cut in devotion Gong kayo I will only  live in when the parks return home  unexpectedly from the camping trip they  have no idea about the violence or the  decadence that has taken place in their  home as far as they know Jung sook has  been quietly tending the home while they  were away the viewer knows that it was  quite the contrary however and that not  only are the housekeeper and her husband  trapped in the underground bunker about  to each the parks also know nothing  about but the Kim's are still there as  well hiding in various locations waiting  for the parks to go to bed then mr. and  mrs. Park go sleep on the couch and mr.  Park is talking about how Mr Kim smells  he is unaware of course that mr. Kim  is hearing him saying that while the  Kim's are hiding under the table but we  the audience are aware of all that  information this is dramatic irony at  its best  so with dramatic irony we are ending the  parasite series on this channel but we  made another video about situational  irony which is available on our patreon  page on our patreon page you will also  find eight extra tips from pulp fiction  and for extra tips from Goodfellas that  we don't share anywhere else the link to  our patreon page is in the description  below let us know in the comments which  tip from parasite was your favorite and  from which films you would like to learn  screenwriting tips in our future videos  keep writing and see you in the next  video

